{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 132,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.31520080566406,
        527.3074340820312,
        82.22920227050781
      ],
      "text": "3.\t  The MDR/RR-TB case burden of a country could influence equitable access at centralized",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        84.66120147705078,
        526.8280639648438,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "In some settings with high caseloads, the targeted NGS technology capacity in  levels.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        100.16120147705078,
        526.9654541015625,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "central laboratories may not be sufficient for processing large caseloads in good time; also,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        115.66120147705078,
        524.396484375,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "in settings with low caseloads, waiting for sufficient samples to batch-test will cause delays.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.993748664855957,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        141.1728057861328,
        275.1541442871094,
        157.5528106689453
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        166.3037109375,
        526.9371948242188,
        179.44871520996094
      ],
      "text": "Although the evidence that is available supports the use of targeted NGS to detect drug",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        180.3037109375,
        527.21240234375,
        193.44871520996094
      ],
      "text": "resistance after TB diagnosis, to guide clinical decision-making for DR-TB treatment, the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.3037109375,
        426.0832824707031,
        207.44871520996094
      ],
      "text": "following factors need to be considered when implementing these tests:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        214.05572509765625,
        78.81909942626953,
        227.2007293701172
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        214.05572509765625,
        526.6116333007812,
        227.2007293701172
      ],
      "text": "Regulatory approval from national regulatory authorities or other relevant bodies is required",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.955610275268555,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        229.55572509765625,
        322.9324035644531,
        242.7007293701172
      ],
      "text": "before implementation of these diagnostic tests.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        245.05572509765625,
        78.81909942626953,
        258.20074462890625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        245.05572509765625,
        527.2286987304688,
        258.20074462890625
      ],
      "text": "In its current format, targeted NGS is a high complexity test that is most suitable for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        260.55572509765625,
        450.3768615722656,
        273.70074462890625
      ],
      "text": "centralized laboratories equipped with specialized skills and infrastructure.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        276.05572509765625,
        78.81909942626953,
        289.20074462890625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        276.05572509765625,
        526.8522338867188,
        289.20074462890625
      ],
      "text": "Targeted NGS tests do not replace existing rapid tests that are more accessible and easier to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.984939575195312,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        291.55572509765625,
        526.9677124023438,
        304.70074462890625
      ],
      "text": "perform for detecting resistance to rifampicin, isoniazid and fluoroquinolones. However, if",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        307.05572509765625,
        527.019287109375,
        320.20074462890625
      ],
      "text": "targeted NGS can be performed rapidly, it can be considered as an alternative initial option",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        322.5556945800781,
        527.1782836914062,
        335.7007141113281
      ],
      "text": "for prioritized populations. Those who will benefit most from these tests are individuals who",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.966499328613281,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        338.0556945800781,
        480.394775390625,
        351.2007141113281
      ],
      "text": "require rapid and comprehensive DST but have limited access to phenotypic DST.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.5556945800781,
        78.81909942626953,
        366.7007141113281
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        353.5556945800781,
        526.9425048828125,
        366.7007141113281
      ],
      "text": "Priority should be given to samples with a high bacillary load as determined by initial",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        369.0556945800781,
        526.9095458984375,
        382.2007141113281
      ],
      "text": "bacteriological tests (e.g. semiquantitative high/medium or smear-positive grading). In",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        384.5556945800781,
        524.5534057617188,
        397.7007141113281
      ],
      "text": "situations where the bacillary load is low (e.g. semiquantitative low/very low/trace or smear-",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.959726333618164,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        400.0556945800781,
        526.9752197265625,
        413.2007141113281
      ],
      "text": "negative grading), the recommendations still hold, although rates of indeterminate results",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        415.5556945800781,
        527.019287109375,
        428.7007141113281
      ],
      "text": "are likely to be higher; therefore, phenotypic DST is likely still required for samples with a",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        431.0556945800781,
        173.24710083007812,
        444.2007141113281
      ],
      "text": "low bacillary load.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        446.5556945800781,
        78.81909942626953,
        459.7007141113281
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        446.5556945800781,
        526.952392578125,
        459.7007141113281
      ],
      "text": "Similarly, the recommendations apply to children, adolescents and PLHIV populations",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        462.0556945800781,
        509.6983947753906,
        475.2007141113281
      ],
      "text": "because these populations have a higher frequency of samples with low bacterial load.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        477.5556945800781,
        78.81909942626953,
        490.7007141113281
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        477.5556945800781,
        527.0182495117188,
        490.7007141113281
      ],
      "text": "The recommendation is based on data obtained from sputum and BAL specimens, and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        493.0556945800781,
        526.9752197265625,
        506.2007141113281
      ],
      "text": "can be extrapolated to other lower respiratory tract samples (e.g. endotracheal aspirates).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        508.5556640625,
        526.8591918945312,
        521.70068359375
      ],
      "text": "However, further research is needed to evaluate the use of these tests on alternative sample",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.977126121520996,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        524.0556640625,
        527.2250366210938,
        537.20068359375
      ],
      "text": "types for diagnosing pulmonary TB in children (e.g. nasopharyngeal and stool samples) and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.989845275878906,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        539.5556640625,
        238.2453155517578,
        552.70068359375
      ],
      "text": "diagnosing extrapulmonary TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        555.0556640625,
        78.81909942626953,
        568.20068359375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        555.0556640625,
        527.0194091796875,
        568.20068359375
      ],
      "text": "Since sensitivity for bedaquiline, linezolid and clofazimine resistance is suboptimal,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        570.5556640625,
        526.98681640625,
        583.70068359375
      ],
      "text": "consideration of the pretest probability is important in interpreting the targeted NGS",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        586.0557250976562,
        524.4563598632812,
        599.2007446289062
      ],
      "text": "results for these drugs. Further testing of samples with a susceptible result (using culture-",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        601.5557250976562,
        527.0634155273438,
        614.7007446289062
      ],
      "text": "based phenotypic DST) would be warranted, particularly when the risk of resistance is",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        617.0557250976562,
        526.963134765625,
        630.2007446289062
      ],
      "text": "high. Since specificity is high, a result that indicates resistance may be used to guide the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        632.5557250976562,
        526.964111328125,
        645.7007446289062
      ],
      "text": "therapy, particularly among those at risk for resistance. In the case of pretomanid, the basis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        648.0557250976562,
        526.975341796875,
        661.2007446289062
      ],
      "text": "for resistance has not been fully elucidated; hence, culture-based DST is also required for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        663.5557250976562,
        131.31600952148438,
        676.7007446289062
      ],
      "text": "this drug.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        38.466400146484375,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "116 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}